This repository contains project-owned orchestration, validation, configuration,
documentation, and small algorithm modules. It does not vendor the referenced
upstream repositories, model weights, datasets, RDK toolchains, or board binaries.

The repository includes patch files intended for separately obtained upstream
projects. Those upstream projects retain their own copyright and license terms.
The exact repositories, revisions, and observed license metadata are recorded in
inventory/ and config/. In particular, referenced projects include Roboparty,
D-Robotics, KISS-ICP, Isaac Lab, Open3D, ROS 2/Nav2, Depth Anything V2, ASAP,
WBC-AGILE, and their transitive dependencies.

